  "text": "## Complaint Categories & Handling  \n### 1. Service Complaints  \n**Example:** Long wait, incorrect information, rude staff  \n**Investigation:**\n- Check timeline\n- Review procedures followed\n- Assess reasonableness\n- Interview staff if needed  \n**Resolution:**\n- If at fault: Apology + compensation for inconvenience\n- Compensation: Up to £100 for minor inconvenience, more if significant distress/loss\n- Learning: Process improvement to prevent recurrence",
